{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32690","headline":"和友人下第北游感怀 · 李频","name":"和友人下第北游感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代爲儒可致身，谁知又别五陵春。\n青门独出空归鸟，紫陌相逢尽醉人。\n江岛去寻垂钓远，塞山来见举头频。\n且须共漉边城酒，何必陶家有白纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}